        "text_ejeeGV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>With over 25 years of experience designing and crafting beautiful bridal gowns, Julie Sufi is considered one of the best wedding dress designers in the world. Combining timeless elegance and neo-romanticism, he tastefully incorporates iconic vintage references and the classic beauty of the past with the present. His designs blur the line between the brand's ready-to-wear and bridal ranges, embodying the well thought-out expansion of the collections to create versatile styles suitable for all brides.</p>"
