        "description": "<p><strong>FOUNDER & HEAD DESIGNER, JULIE SUFI COTURE</strong><br/></p><p>Julie Sufi is an Australian couture designer celebrated for her hand beaded artistry and sculptural bridal silhouettes. With a vision rooted in timeless elegance and modern femininity, Julie creates gowns that merge traditional couture craftsmanship with a contemporary sensibility.<br/><br/>Each piece reflects an intimate dialogue between fabric, form, and emotion. Hours of meticulous handwork, from cascading pearls to intricate bead embroidery, layered into designs that honour the feminine silhouette while telling deeply personal stories.<br/>Through her namesake label, Julie Sufi invites brides to step into pieces that are as individual as they are unforgettable. Her designs are recognised for their luxurious detailing, fluid drapery, and delicate structure, making every gown a work of art created with intention.<br/><br/>With the debut of her Mon Coeur collection at New York Bridal Market 2025, Julie reintroduces her vision on the international stage redefining modern couture for the bride who seeks beauty, meaning, and quiet confidence.<br/></p>",
        "show_cta_box": true,
        "cta_eyebrow": "Gowns from",
